<ProjectLayout slug="delayed-choice">
  <p>
    <em>delayed choice</em> explores the uncertainty of perception
    and the temporal gap between an event and its recognition.
  </p>

  <p>
    By combining controlled movement with subtle temporal shifts,
    the video invites the viewer to question whether what is seen is
    determined by the present moment or continuously rewritten by
    what follows.
  </p>

